[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあみんな、片付けを始めるわよー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, everyone! Time to clean up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "昨日の夜は片付けって雰囲気じゃなかったけど……\n日を置くとより面倒に感じちゃうわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Last night wasn't exactly the right mood for tidying up... but the longer you leave it, the worse it gets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、そうだね。長引くとよりめんどくさくなるから\nちゃちゃっと終わらせちゃおう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, true enough. Better to just knock it out before it becomes a bigger pain."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's do it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、ここの片付けは終わりね！\nなんか、前より片付いてる気がするわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay, all done in here! It actually feels cleaner than before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "当然です。片付けは、\nただ以前の形に戻すのみではありません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Naturally. Tidying up is not merely about restoring things to how they were."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕、疲れたよー。\nヴァレリア、お茶淹れてくれない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm exhausted. Hey, Valeria, could you make some tea?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私が淹れましょう！\u3000ナナたちも飲みたいだろう？\nみんなで一服しよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll make it! Everyone could use a cup, couldn't they? Let's all take a break together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう！\u3000そうね、\nみんなで向こうで飲みましょっか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That sounds wonderful! Come on, let's go sit over there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……あ、あ！\u3000ああ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Oh—oh! OHHHH!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゼロ姉貴、どうし――ああっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero, what's—oh!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも？\u3000なに――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two? What's—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "間抜け面をさらすな。弱く見える",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wipe those looks off your faces. You look pathetic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄者あああーーー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Brother!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "兄貴！\u3000元気になったんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're back! You're really back!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配したよ、ヘル兄。\nもう気分は大丈夫なのかい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were worried about you. Feeling better now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。問題ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I'm fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たち兄弟の絆ですね、兄様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The power of our bond, Brother!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕たちを振り回して、腹が立つんだけど？\nというか、まだスープの感想聞いてないよねぇ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You put us through all that and you don't even feel bad about it? And we still haven't heard what you thought of the soup!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、あのスープ、お前たちが作ったんだったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, right. You all made that soup."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うまかった。さすが、俺のレシピだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It was good. No surprise—it was my recipe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うむ、さすが兄者じゃあ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! Only brother could say something like that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっはは！\u3000もうすっかりいつも通りみたいだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! Yep, he's completely back to his old self."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう……ほんと、心配したんだから。\n元気になってよかったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You had us so worried... I'm just glad you're alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hmph."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前らが果ての大陸へ向かうため、\n俺も力を貸してやろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll lend you my strength to reach World's End."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「貸してやろう」……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "\"Lend\" us your strength...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "シトリン、なんか言ったか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine. Did you say something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いっ、いや、ナニモ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, nothing at all..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ビビるなら言わなきゃいいのにねぇ。\nまぁ、少しずつ免疫をつけてくこった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you're going to chicken out, don't say it in the first place. Guess you'll just have to build up a thicker skin."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヘルト、力を貸してくれるのは嬉しいんだけど……\nそれって、私たちに負けたから……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad you want to help, but... is it because we beat you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はっ、戯言を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hah. Don't be ridiculous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺はお前らの兄として、\n俺がやるべきことをやるだけだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As your eldest brother, I'm simply doing what I should."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前らにはまだまだ\n長兄である俺の存在が必要みたいだからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's clear you still need me around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふふ、そっか。\n改めてこれからよろしくね、ヘルト！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hehe. I'll take it. Thanks, Held. We're counting on you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "俺を失望させるなよ。\n俺がいるからには、敗北も失敗も許さん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't disappoint me. As long as I'm here, I will not tolerate defeat or failure."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ！\u3000成長した私たちの姿、見せてあげる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then we'll show you just how far we've come!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで、九偉人全員が揃ったね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All nine of us are together now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちに課せられた使命、果たす時は近い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The time to fulfill our mission draws near."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ナナは安心して、兄弟に頼るといい！\n全力で手助けしよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't hesitate to lean on us, Nana! We'll give everything we've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パルメ族がなぜレスナやお前さんを果ての大陸へ\n行かせたがるのか。その真意も行けば分かるさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why the Palme want you and Resna to reach World's End—we'll find our answers once we get there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "暗黒の氷海……あそこの魔物は\n戦い甲斐がある。腕が鳴るのぉ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The Midnight Sea... the monsters there are worthy opponents. My blood is pumping already!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、みんながいてくれたら心強いわ。\n果ての大陸まで、よろしくね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With everyone here, I feel like we can do anything. Let's make it to World's End—together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "準備ができたら連絡してください。\n私たちも用意を整えておきます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please let us know when you are ready to depart. We will make our preparations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "果ての大陸、言うだけあって遠かったけど……\n最果てまで、あと少しね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "World's End really does live up to its name... but we're almost there now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]